{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1b3173a2-2afd-8a7f-8ece-fb26efc81c0d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:09:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Amara Rahman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:07:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:07:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I'm calling about trash pickup. They missed us again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:07:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Missed you again. Okay, I can help with that. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:07:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "336 Malbone Road. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:07:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "336 Malbone Road. And when was the pickup supposed to happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:08:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Our day is Monday, so this morning. But the truck already went down the street and our bins are still full. It's the second miss in a row. Last week they skipped us too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:08:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The second one in a row. Okay. Did the truck go by earlier than usual, do you think, or did you put the bins out late?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:08:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bins were out last night. Earlier than usual, maybe. I don't know, I was already up at six and I didn't hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there anything blocking the bins, a parked car, a snowbank, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:08:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing like that. Oh, but there's something else. A neighbor keeps dumping trash bags at the corner. Just leaves them there by the pole. Maybe that's why the crew got confused, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bags at the corner by the pole. Is that right at the corner of your street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the corner, yeah. Four or five bags this morning. And it's the quiet season, you know? The carousel at that shop on the waterfront stays closed this time of year, so it's not like it's tourists. It's somebody local."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:09:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somebody local, got it. Alright, I'll put in a missed pickup for 336 Malbone, and I'll note the bags at the corner so a supervisor can look at it. Do you want a call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:09:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It's 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:09:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0162. Let me read that back to be sure. Yes, that's what I have. Leave your bins at the curb and someone should get back to you today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave the bins at the curb. Okay. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T09:09:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Rahman. Bye now."
    }
  ],
